"Gemma 3 4B is a lightweight multimodal model developed by Google that accepts both text and images as input and generates text responses. Despite its relatively small size, it supports a 128K token context window, multilingual capability across more than 140 languages, and is designed to run efficiently on local hardware such as laptops and desktops." = "Gemma 3 4B is a lightweight multimodal model developed by Google that accepts both text and images as input and generates text responses. Despite its relatively small size, it supports a 128K token context window, multilingual capability across more than 140 languages, and is designed to run efficiently on local hardware such as laptops and desktops.";
